    <briefdescription>
<para>Each table consists of sets of variable length entries. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Each set describes the names of global objects and functions, or global types, respectively, whose definitions are represented by debugging information entries owned by a single compilation unit. </para>
